  "notes": "Broadly covers making things accessible to the public — films, buildings, information, documents.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {一般|いっぱん}{公開|こうかい} (open to the general public)\n- {情報|じょうほう}{公開|こうかい} (information disclosure)\n- {公開|こうかい}{日|び} (release date)\n- {公開|こうかい}{中|ちゅう} (now showing / currently open)\n- {非公開|ひこうかい} (private, closed to the public)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {公開|こうかい}: making something accessible to the public (films, facilities, information)\n- {発表|はっぴょう}: announcing or presenting (results, plans, research)\n- {公表|こうひょう}: officially making information public (formal announcements)",
